  "narrative": "System experienced sustained brute-force SSH authentication attacks from multiple external IP addresses attempting to compromise root and guest accounts, as well as unknown users. Attacks occurred in coordinated bursts from sources including 220-135-151-1.hinet-ip.hinet.net (10 simultaneous attempts Jun 15), n219076184117.netvigator.com (23 attempts Jun 22), and numerous others. Concurrently, logrotate failed consistently every day at approximately 04:00-04:10 with exit code 1 across 16 occurrences from Jun 15-29. Multiple FTP connection floods were detected from IPs including 82.252.162.81, 210.245.165.136, and others, with bursts of 10-23 simultaneous connections. The combination of authentication failures (189 SSH, 67 unknown users) and the recurring logrotate failure indicates both external attack activity and an internal system maintenance issue."
 },
