  "narrative": "MapReduce job job_1445144423722_0020 experienced catastrophic failure due to network connectivity issues. At 18:05:57, HDFS write pipeline failed with slow read (65020ms) and bad datanode error. Starting at 18:06:01, ResourceManager became unreachable. Two map tasks (attempt_1445144423722_0020_m_000002_0 and attempt_1445144423722_0020_m_000001_0) running on MININT-FNANLI5 failed at 18:06:26 and 18:06:28 with NoRouteToHostException to msra-sa-41:9000. The job history event handler thread crashed at 18:06:26. For over 5 hours, the system continuously failed to contact ResourceManager (178 attempts) and renew HDFS leases (356 failures), with persistent DNS/network address resolution issues between msra-sa-41 IP (10.190.173.170) and hostname. The job became completely stalled with no progress after the initial task failures."
